// The Rellekka hunting grounds, imported from the rev 474 cache (OpenRS2 #237). 377 has no ground here:
// m42_59 is open sea in 377 and the snowy peninsula north-east of Rellekka came with Hunter in November
// 2006, joined to the mountains east of Rellekka by a pass 474 cut through them. So:
//   - m42_59 whole, through tools/models/import474map.py (377's copy was sea and a strip of mountain);
//   - m42_58 through tools/models/import474rect.py: the new land (x 14-63, z 23-63) and 474's snowy pass
//     and valley (x 36-63, z 0-22), levels 0 and 1. The rest of the square - Rellekka's north-east shore
//     and the Fremennik Isles pier 474 added at x 17-20 - is 377's, untouched;
//   - m43_58 terrain only, x 0-3 z 6-40: 474 re-heighted its west edge to meet the new valley.
// These are the locs 474 places there that the 377 content did not already have. Its minimap icons
// (quest start, transport, hunter training, 7054/19750) and the area-sound locs without a sound in this
// build (16403, 16455) are left out; the ones Lunar Isle already gave a sound (16430-16432, 16446) are
// placed as those.
//
// Ops were edited after import. A loc op with no handler is a dead click, so:
//   - the snowy dead tree is an ordinary tree (category=tree, trees.dbrow);
//   - the holes, tunnels and hollow logs (Inspect) and the snow drifts (Search, Attack) are live: polar
//     kebbit tracking (scripts/hunter_rellekka.rs2). The holes, tunnels and logs carry
//     category=hunter_polar_track_node, not the Feldip category, so each ground has its own trail;
//   - the Steps up to the plateau and back down are live (scripts/hunter_rellekka.rs2);
//   - the boulders (loc474_19205) and pits (loc474_19227) are Feldip's, and so already live;
//   - the eagles' Cave and the Rocky handholds beside it are the way into the polar eagles' eyrie (Eagles'
//     Peak, 2006: quests/quest_eaglespeak/scripts/eaglespeak_transport.rs2); the Fairy ring (this build
//     has no fairy-ring travel) and the Windswept tree (no quest here uses it) lead nowhere yet.


[loc474_1291]
// rev 474 loc 1291 (import474map.py)
name=Dead tree
model=loc474_1291
mapscene=6
op1=Chop down
op3=hidden
category=tree
param=next_loc_stage,deadtree2_stump_dark

